-- The unchanged legacy coordinate-vector computation remains in --opened;
-- its anonymous occurrence IDs are shortened by that diagnostic.
-- Reviewed weak-field construction boundaries: span kernels and normalized
-- functionals; bounded polynomial relations; finite coefficient scans;
-- tensor contraction, determinant specialization and finite table laws.
-- Exact field constructions remain checked as separate endpoints.
